# Generated outputs of the test harness (Sigil-Logic/clafer#22, PR #27
# review): make -C test test compiles every test/positive/*.cfr to
# Alloy, Choco, HTML, and Graph output next to its model; the
# committed baselines live in test/regression/*.reg, and make -C test
# clean removes the generated tree.
test/positive/*.als
test/positive/*.js
test/positive/*.html
test/positive/*.dot
test/positive/*.dot.svg
# Transient discovery manifests (normally removed by the recipes and
# by make clean; they linger only after an interrupted run)
test/.*.list
test/.*.list.names
# Harness-local copy of the compiler binary (test/Makefile invokes
# ../clafer); build with stack and copy it here
/clafer
